    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winter Winds is a dark fantasy psychological horror game with gameplay based on environmental exploration and turn based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may be mute, and an objectively bad person, but you're also the only one out here facing the monsters around every corner. Good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972710/extras/1ee081b0eb40d32cdda898db6cd96f75.avif?t=1734630964\" width=480 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Features.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >O - Restore the sun alone or let the candid neighborhood Angel detective, Aly, <i>and her shotgun</i>, join you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X - Discover 9 different endings, <i>some being more serious than others.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >O - Explore to find secrets and Icehearts to raise your stats in 2bit stylized, mostly abandoned town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X - <i>Loosen your grip on reality to inflict more damage!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >O - Discover a way to be able to speak and find out what your name could be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X - <i>Brace yourself for two unique opportunities to get scammed!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >O - Utilize normal weapons or magic spells to kill night creatures and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X - Playthrough with several different game modes or cheat codes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winter Winds in my experience takes on average about 2 - 2.5 hours to complete with normal settings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has / is being developed by one person, so please excuse any unprofessional mistakes that may be present.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have any questions or inquiries, you can email me at @ <a href=\"mailto:bustonuttt@gmail.com\">bustonuttt@gmail.com</a>.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winter Winds is a dark fantasy psychological horror game with gameplay based on environmental exploration and turn based combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may be mute, and an objectively bad person, but you're also the only one out here facing the monsters around every corner. Good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2972710/extras/1ee081b0eb40d32cdda898db6cd96f75.avif?t=1734630964\" width=480 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Features.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >O - Restore the sun alone or let the candid neighborhood Angel detective, Aly, <i>and her shotgun</i>, join you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X - Discover 9 different endings, <i>some being more serious than others.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >O - Explore to find secrets and Icehearts to raise your stats in 2bit stylized, mostly abandoned town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X - <i>Loosen your grip on reality to inflict more damage!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >O - Discover a way to be able to speak and find out what your name could be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X - <i>Brace yourself for two unique opportunities to get scammed!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >O - Utilize normal weapons or magic spells to kill night creatures and bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X - Playthrough with several different game modes or cheat codes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Winter Winds in my experience takes on average about 2 - 2.5 hours to complete with normal settings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has / is being developed by one person, so please excuse any unprofessional mistakes that may be present.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have any questions or inquiries, you can email me at @ <a href=\"mailto:bustonuttt@gmail.com\">bustonuttt@gmail.com</a>.</p>",
